title: $:/plugins/mblackman/mermaid/settings

! Mermaid Settings

Configure default diagram rendering options:

|!Setting |!Description |!Value |
|''Theme'' |Diagram color theme |<$select tiddler="$:/config/mblackman/mermaid/theme" default="auto"><optgroup label="Dynamic & Legibility-First"><option value="auto">Auto (Matches active TiddlyWiki palette)</option><option value="palette">Active Palette (Explicit)</option><option value="high-contrast">High Contrast (WCAG AAA >= 7:1)</option><option value="technical">Technical / Blueprint</option><option value="monochrome">Monochrome (Clean grayscale)</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Modern Mermaid v11"><option value="redux-auto">Redux Auto (Modern adaptive)</option><option value="redux">Redux Light</option><option value="redux-dark">Redux Dark</option><option value="redux-color-auto">Redux Color Auto (Vibrant adaptive)</option><option value="redux-color">Redux Color Light</option><option value="redux-color-dark">Redux Color Dark</option><option value="neo-auto">Neo Auto (Soft adaptive)</option><option value="neo">Neo Light</option><option value="neo-dark">Neo Dark</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Classic Mermaid"><option value="default">Default (Classic Light)</option><option value="dark">Classic Dark</option><option value="forest">Forest (Green tones)</option><option value="neutral">Neutral (Classic grayscale)</option><option value="base">Base</option></optgroup></$select> |
|''Security Level'' |Mermaid script evaluation policy |<$select tiddler="$:/config/mblackman/mermaid/securityLevel" default="loose"><option value="loose">Loose (Recommended, allows click callbacks)</option><option value="strict">Strict (Tags are sanitized)</option><option value="antiscript">Antiscript (HTML tags allowed, scripts removed)</option><option value="sandbox">Sandbox (Iframe sandbox)</option></$select> |
